  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Communication and visibility of the EU cooperation with Cambodia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To raise, in Cambodia, the visibility of the EU as a key player in development cooperation based on EU values such as good governance, democracy, human rights, and the rule of law, and focusing on quality service delivery, inclusive and sustainable development results.To  enhance, in Europe, the visibility of EU development cooperation with Cambodia, otably EU&apos;s contribution to making a difference for the lives of Cambodian people, youth and disadvantaged groups.</narrative>
  </description>
